{
  "native_artifact_sha256": "76318242224f38da7383ae00bcbc5cc344709c95ba03ac288f133830e0ebc4e2",
  "sdk_segments": [
    {
      "text": "Um, after—",
      "start_ms": 660,
      "end_ms": 1620,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 0,
      "token_end_index": 4
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, that's an option too. Hmm, after dinner. Sure.",
      "start_ms": 1740,
      "end_ms": 5640,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 4,
      "token_end_index": 23
    },
    {
      "text": " Today is a good day, but we have 12. What's your— what would you prefer?",
      "start_ms": 6180,
      "end_ms": 10260,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 23,
      "token_end_index": 51
    },
    {
      "text": " Or 3:30. I just— yeah.",
      "start_ms": 10380,
      "end_ms": 13320,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 51,
      "token_end_index": 62
    },
    {
      "text": " Well, it doesn't matter the time.",
      "start_ms": 13800,
      "end_ms": 15060,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 62,
      "token_end_index": 73
    },
    {
      "text": " Necessarily.",
      "start_ms": 15120,
      "end_ms": 15480,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 73,
      "token_end_index": 79
    },
    {
      "text": " 3:30 in the— in the computer room in here, and we just.",
      "start_ms": 15720,
      "end_ms": 17880,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 79,
      "token_end_index": 99
    },
    {
      "text": " Get in there, though.",
      "start_ms": 18600,
      "end_ms": 19320,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 99,
      "token_end_index": 108
    },
    {
      "text": " If you can't— can you get in the front door? Oh, you haven't got a key, do you? Can none of you get in?",
      "start_ms": 19740,
      "end_ms": 24000,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 108,
      "token_end_index": 148
    },
    {
      "text": " We. Can get in through the— through the—",
      "start_ms": 24000,
      "end_ms": 26280,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 148,
      "token_end_index": 159
    },
    {
      "text": " The computer rooms in here, the MSC computer rooms.",
      "start_ms": 26460,
      "end_ms": 29340,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 159,
      "token_end_index": 176
    },
    {
      "text": " I've not found that yet.",
      "start_ms": 29400,
      "end_ms": 30120,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 176,
      "token_end_index": 184
    },
    {
      "text": " Right.",
      "start_ms": 30120,
      "end_ms": 30120,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 184,
      "token_end_index": 187
    },
    {
      "text": " How about if we take a—",
      "start_ms": 30840,
      "end_ms": 31620,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 187,
      "token_end_index": 195
    },
    {
      "text": " Or if you find me, I'll show you where— I'll let us all in there, and we can all go in there.",
      "start_ms": 31680,
      "end_ms": 35760,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 195,
      "token_end_index": 229
    },
    {
      "text": " We can look. Now, afterwards.",
      "start_ms": 35940,
      "end_ms": 37560,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 229,
      "token_end_index": 238
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, yeah, yeah.",
      "start_ms": 37740,
      "end_ms": 38280,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 238,
      "token_end_index": 244
    },
    {
      "text": " Exactly.",
      "start_ms": 38340,
      "end_ms": 38580,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 244,
      "token_end_index": 248
    },
    {
      "text": " You do need to have a key for it, though. That's the thing. It's got to lock the door, but—",
      "start_ms": 38820,
      "end_ms": 41640,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 248,
      "token_end_index": 279
    },
    {
      "text": " Just bang on it.",
      "start_ms": 41820,
      "end_ms": 42360,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 279,
      "token_end_index": 284
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, somebody'll ask.",
      "start_ms": 43080,
      "end_ms": 43800,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 284,
      "token_end_index": 293
    },
    {
      "text": " Actually, I was asking Steve about that, whether we can get in there. Whether he was going to get us access into there.",
      "start_ms": 43800,
      "end_ms": 48480,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 293,
      "token_end_index": 330
    },
    {
      "text": " Into what?",
      "start_ms": 49200,
      "end_ms": 49680,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 330,
      "token_end_index": 335
    },
    {
      "text": " The computer room.",
      "start_ms": 49800,
      "end_ms": 50400,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 335,
      "token_end_index": 340
    },
    {
      "text": " Okay.",
      "start_ms": 50520,
      "end_ms": 50760,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 340,
      "token_end_index": 342
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. It's only got— it's crap. It's only got about 4 or 5 computers in, but it would do. Quite good for our job, because it can also— it's not very normally with people in it, right?",
      "start_ms": 51420,
      "end_ms": 58860,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 342,
      "token_end_index": 404
    },
    {
      "text": " Right. Is there a printer there too?",
      "start_ms": 59220,
      "end_ms": 60720,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 404,
      "token_end_index": 416
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. There's a printer in there. And there's a photocopier. With the code on it, you know?",
      "start_ms": 60720,
      "end_ms": 65100,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 416,
      "token_end_index": 449
    },
    {
      "text": " Yes.",
      "start_ms": 65280,
      "end_ms": 65520,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 449,
      "token_end_index": 451
    },
    {
      "text": " That's cool.",
      "start_ms": 66060,
      "end_ms": 66420,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 451,
      "token_end_index": 455
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 66600,
      "end_ms": 66780,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 455,
      "token_end_index": 457
    },
    {
      "text": " Huh. Well, I'm just—",
      "start_ms": 68100,
      "end_ms": 69900,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 457,
      "token_end_index": 467
    },
    {
      "text": " We can photocopy our assignment. If we want to.",
      "start_ms": 69960,
      "end_ms": 72960,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 467,
      "token_end_index": 487
    },
    {
      "text": " We've got it on my computer.",
      "start_ms": 74100,
      "end_ms": 75180,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 487,
      "token_end_index": 497
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. All the comments I'm thinking.",
      "start_ms": 75540,
      "end_ms": 76980,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 497,
      "token_end_index": 509
    },
    {
      "text": " So what time do we say? I just think it's better to do it afterwards than we have all the time and—",
      "start_ms": 77520,
      "end_ms": 82500,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 509,
      "token_end_index": 539
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, that's true.",
      "start_ms": 82500,
      "end_ms": 82920,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 539,
      "token_end_index": 546
    },
    {
      "text": " So after half an",
      "start_ms": 82920,
      "end_ms": 84180,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 546,
      "token_end_index": 551
    },
    {
      "text": " hour, and then we'll actually. Yeah. Yeah. Okay.",
      "start_ms": 84180,
      "end_ms": 89400,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 551,
      "token_end_index": 568
    },
    {
      "text": " As long as the analogy doesn't. Go late.",
      "start_ms": 90480,
      "end_ms": 92220,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 568,
      "token_end_index": 581
    },
    {
      "text": " Hopefully it's not that man, so it won't matter.",
      "start_ms": 93660,
      "end_ms": 95280,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 581,
      "token_end_index": 598
    },
    {
      "text": " Actually, it's not even confirmed yet.",
      "start_ms": 98220,
      "end_ms": 99900,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 598,
      "token_end_index": 611
    },
    {
      "text": " What?",
      "start_ms": 100740,
      "end_ms": 100980,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 611,
      "token_end_index": 614
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh.",
      "start_ms": 101160,
      "end_ms": 101340,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 614,
      "token_end_index": 616
    },
    {
      "text": " She doesn't even know what she's talking about. Maybe it doesn't happen at all.",
      "start_ms": 101580,
      "end_ms": 106140,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 616,
      "token_end_index": 644
    },
    {
      "text": " Sounds like me.",
      "start_ms": 107340,
      "end_ms": 107820,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 644,
      "token_end_index": 650
    },
    {
      "text": " It's really weird next week. It should be. Should it be?",
      "start_ms": 107940,
      "end_ms": 109680,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 650,
      "token_end_index": 671
    },
    {
      "text": " Really?",
      "start_ms": 110700,
      "end_ms": 111000,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 671,
      "token_end_index": 674
    },
    {
      "text": " What? It's supposed to be.",
      "start_ms": 111360,
      "end_ms": 112320,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 674,
      "token_end_index": 685
    },
    {
      "text": " A weekend.",
      "start_ms": 112380,
      "end_ms": 112920,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 685,
      "token_end_index": 690
    },
    {
      "text": " Next week. It's week 6 next week.",
      "start_ms": 113460,
      "end_ms": 115380,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 690,
      "token_end_index": 703
    },
    {
      "text": " Really?",
      "start_ms": 115500,
      "end_ms": 115800,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 703,
      "token_end_index": 706
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh.",
      "start_ms": 115800,
      "end_ms": 115800,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 706,
      "token_end_index": 708
    },
    {
      "text": " I don't think we have a reading week, though. I don't know. We have one class, at least, when we speech perception. We don't have any lectures. ",
      "start_ms": 116400,
      "end_ms": 121920,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 708,
      "token_end_index": 756
    }
